{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45347","headline":"杂寓兴 · 皎然","name":"杂寓兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嗟嗟号呶子，世称谪僊俦。\n媚俗被鲛绡，欺天荐昫修。\n奔景谓可致，驰龄言易流。\n燕昭昧往事，嬴政亡前筹。\n三山果不见，九僊忽悠悠。\n君看牛山乐，君见麋浦游。\n昨日千金子，联绵成古丘。\n吾将揽明月，照尔生死流。\n至乐享爰居，慙贻达者尤。\n冥冥光尘内，机丧成海沤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}